\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. O God our Father, who dost make
\par us one,
\par Heart bound to heart, in love of
\par Thy dear Son,
\par Now as we part and go our several ways,
\par Touch every lip, may every voice be
\par praise-
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Praise for the fellowship that here
\par we find,
\par The fellowship of heart and soul
\par and mind,
\par Praise for the bonds of love and 
\par brotherhood,
\par Bonds wrought by Thee, who
\par makest all things good.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Lord, make us strong, for Thou
\par alone dost know
\par How oft we turn our faces from the 
\par foe;
\par How oft, when claimed by dark
\par temptation's hour,
\par We lose our hold on Thee, and
\par of Thy power.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Go with us, Lord, from hence;
\par we only ask
\par That Thou be sharer in our daily task;
\par So, side by side with Thee, shall
\par each one know
\par The blessedness of heaven begun
\par below.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

